sequenceDiagram
    participant VAD as Silero VAD
    participant AG as Agent
    participant TTS_T as TTS Task
    participant LLM_T as LLM Task

    VAD->>AG: Speech onset during TTS playback
    AG->>AG: Acquire _pipeline_lock
    AG->>TTS_T: task.cancel()
    TTS_T-->>AG: CancelledError caught
    AG->>LLM_T: task.cancel()
    LLM_T-->>AG: CancelledError caught
    AG->>AG: _tts_task = None\n_llm_task = None\n_barge_in_event.set()
    Note over AG: Pipeline reset — ready for new utterance